ategory_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IME3_lp9coh9_S3GTmAXZg","review_id":"E6kNxu_9_vCsJbkctaWp4Q","date":"2018-07-25T22:11:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8863461017608643,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I stopped into Wolf's in the Warehouse to grab a quick lunch. There was nothing quick about our service but the meal was delicious. My husband ordered the Chef's Special sandwich and it taste similar to a Italian panini. ($16.00) The bread, meat and cheese was fresh and tasty. I loved the crunchy bread. I ordered a Shrimp Po Boy. ($16.00) The bread was wonderfully fresh and the shrimp was breaded and cooked perfectly. The mayo was spread sparingly and the lettuce was clean and cold. We waited almost 30 minutes for our sandwiches. When they arrived the french fries were room temperature. I asked our waitress if she would get me some fresh made fries and she pleasantly agreed..."},{"business_id":"IME3_lp9coh9_S3GTmAXZg","review_id":"JaVxDyh980JWW9zjxp4wCg","date":"2015-06-16T01:51:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8666595220565796,"text_excerpt":"For a hotel lounge.....amazing. Happy hour from 7-9 with $3 draft (including premium), $3 craft beer, and $3 off signature cocktails! I was able to give the bartender a 100% tip for the first time in my life! Feelin' like Jay Z, jigga what!"},{"business_id":"IME3_lp9coh9_S3GTmAXZg","review_id":"JKveEdgwURmIofkrtwp-6A","date":"2019-03-26T17:39:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8619285821914673,"text_excerpt":"Excellent gumbo loaded with andouille and chicken in a rich, spicy sauce. Creole Caesar very tasty and generous portion. Shrimp creole very tasty. Reasonable prices and good service."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IME3_lp9coh9_S3GTmAXZg","photo_id":"WANyOR49nZVJU0v786A43w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WANyOR49nZVJU0v786A43w.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
